WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.730
<b>Conception Masterpiece Theater</b>

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.970
That is Collette, the Maiden of Aquarius.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.160
A virtuous girl everyone 
in town knows about.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.920
She runs the bakery for her 
grandfather who became sick.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.880
Admirable and innocent.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.840
She knows nothing of corruption in the world.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.210
"Babies are delivered to the 
cabbage field by storks!"

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.350
She's like everyone's little sister!

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:44.110
And you're gonna corrupt 
that girl to your liking!

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.080
Like stepping into undisturbed snow.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.820
Like painting on a brand new canvas.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.990
Twisted urges going haywire,
 full of desire, crotches on fire!

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.190
Check it out! Like that?

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:57.590
This is painful.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.290
It may be in order to cleanse 
the Impurities in this world,

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.790
but this girl, full of innocence...

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.380
Must I do something like 
this... and that... to her?

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:14.560
Must I really be the one to defile her?

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.470
Hey, you've already done 
that to all the girls!

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.970
Actually, the Visitor who hunts down 
Impurities shouldn't be talking about defiling!

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:24.230
What should I do?

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:27.770
What are you concerned about, 
after all you've been through?!

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.980
Get your ass over there!

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.280
Heave-ho, heave-ho.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.130
Collette.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:11.040
I'll leave the flour here.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.950
Oh, okay.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:15.480
What should I do next?

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.570
Um... Is it really all right,

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.920
to have you helping out the bakery?

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:23.500
You must be busy being a Visitor.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.130
Don't worry about it.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.070
I'm helping out because I want to.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.100
But...

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.420
Um...

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.600
You're helping me out...

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:35.610
because you want to make a 
Star Child with me, right?

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.790
Having you help me out for that reason...

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.190
Um... You're putting me in a difficult spot.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:46.220
My hands are full running this bakery.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.260
It's not like that!

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.600
I, uh...

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.310
Yeah, I want to help you, Collette!

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.290
You want to help me out?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:56.860
You started working early in the 
morning, but still kept your smile.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:04:00.210
People who bought your bread 
were smiling the same way.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.470
I thought that was amazing.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.190
That's why I want to help you.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.850
Onii-san...

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:10.350
But you're making a Star Child with me, right?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.710
No, I have no intention...

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.680
Well, I do, but...

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.260
It's far in the future.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:21.260
That's after we understand each other...

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.000
You're an honest one, aren't you?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.320
I'm relieved.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.560
I'm looking forward to helping out!

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:30.830
I'm looking forward to it, too.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.830
Baking is actually a lot of physical work.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.920
It must have been tough 
doing it all on your own.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.590
No, not at all!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.670
It was my dream to bake bread!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.340
Your dream?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.410
Yes!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:48.890
People will be happy to eat the bread I make.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:52.890
That's the dream I've had since I was a child.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.680
When I see the bright smile on Collette,

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:00.840
{doushitemo}it makes me want to defile her!

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:05.480
I want to knead her up like 
 dough in my hands.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.410
Don't voice me without my permission!

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.630
They're baked well!

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.090
They look tasty!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.300
Would you like to try one?

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.550
Here, open your mouth!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.430
Come on, open your mouth!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.360
Uh, but...

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:35.390
Hurry and eat it. You're embarrassing me.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.950
Okay.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.110
Ah!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:45.360
How does it taste?

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.860
It's great!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.370
That's good!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.640
But bread can't satisfy me.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:57.560
You're the one I want to feast on, Collette.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:59.830
I told you not to do that!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.160
I can't let my guard down even for a second.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.340
Let's put out the freshly-baked bread.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.080
Your customers are waiting.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:12.850
Okay...

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.110
Not many customers today.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.100
Maybe there's a huge bread 
sale going on somewhere.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:26.780
No.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.570
It's been like this ever 
since Grandpa fell ill.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.960
Grandpa?

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:31.570
Yes.

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:36.450
He was a genius baker, and there were 
always long lines at the bakery.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.210
But ever since I took over...

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.250
Maybe I don't have what it takes.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.710
Collette...

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.960
Her smile was bright as an 
angel just a moment ago,

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:51.350
but now she's shivering like 
a puppy soaked in the rain!

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:55.550
Yeah, let's put a bigger frown on her face!

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:59.200
Mana, really, cut it out!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.040
I'll be back.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.600
Please, don't get in my way.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.320
Collette...

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.100
Itsuki,

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.660
we came over.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.960
Mahiru! Arie!

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:17.950
What's wrong?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.490
What's wrong? Why can't we come to a bakery?

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.620
We heard that Itsuki-san was working here,

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.870
so we were wondering if we 
could do anything to help.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:27.630
Oh, thank you!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.700
Thank you for coming!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:35.200
All right! We're gonna 
sell lots of bread today!

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:36.760
Y-Yes.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.270
No customers...

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:45.440
Collette, is there any reason for this?

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.400
Everyone!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:50.060
This is the bakery where Visitor-sama works!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.530
Ah! Bakery!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.640
Looks tasty!

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.280
There's crab-shaped bread!

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.140
Is there a scorpion bread?

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.820
Alfie! Why are you here?

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:00.720
We're always training and 
doing labyrinth explorations,

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.870
so I thought letting them see 
Visitor-sama's everyday life

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.920
would be a good exercise for them.

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:08.350
It's to cultivate an aesthetic sensibility.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.840
Can I have some bread?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.400
I'm hungry.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.200
Visitor-sama!

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.720
Yeah, you can eat as much as you want.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.660
Yay!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.270
Here you go.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.800
Huh? But...

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.900
You owe me one, 'kay?

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:35.410
You're a lifesaver, Alfie.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:39.790
It's been so long since 
we've had so many customers!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.040
I have to bake more bread!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.910
About that, Collette...

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:47.020
Why aren't there any customers?

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:51.080
Is there a reason for it?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.760
Hey, hey, hey!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.450
How long are you gonna 
be doing business here?

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:58.250
I think it's a waste of time 
baking bread like this.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.850
They're not going to sell anyway.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.710
Who are you people?

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:05.040
"Huh? Who are you?" You say?

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.640
I will tell you if you don't know.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:10.360
We are the number one bakery in this country.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.280
Makers of Lunch Packs.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.960
Lunch Packs...

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.780
The ones we see all the time?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.120
Yeah! The ones you see all the time!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.400
Our company was looking for 
prospective land for a new shop,

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:27.420
and this site happens to satisfy 
all our desired conditions.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:31.260
So hurry and hand over this shop!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:36.830
Collette-san, there's no point baking 
bread you can't sell, is there?

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.350
How about you start another business 
using the money from selling the bakery?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:40.930
Well?

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:41.820
Well?

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:42.680
Well?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.680
Well?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.360
Well?

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.190
You guys are noisy!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.960
We're eating bread, so be quiet!

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.190
Who are these kids?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.880
We're not kids! I'm Cancer!

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:55.940
I'm Virgo!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:10:00.880
Kids, adults are working now, 
so can you be quiet?

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:02.920
You old dudes need to be quiet!

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:03.870
Old dudes?!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.540
Is it your job to scare that lady?

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.160
Getting paid to harass people? Losers.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.920
I wonder what you old dudes' moms 
and dads would think of that.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:17.320
I'm sure they would think 
they didn't raise you right!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:20.480
Good thing we were Visitor-sama's children.

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:23.060
Good thing Alfie-san raised us!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:28.560
We're glad that we don't have 
to turn into adults like them!

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:30.310
Dammit!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.250
This isn't over!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.250
Don't bully us!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.090
What would your mom think?

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:36.170
Bye-bye!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:37.870
They've grown strong.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:40.320
It's amazing that they're 
not doing it out of malice.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:44.780
Collette... No customers were 
showing up because of them?

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:45.830
Yes.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:50.670
You can enjoy many flavors of 
Lunch Pack for a reasonable price,

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:51.830
so they're very popular.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:56.090
Because of that, other bakeries 
are going out of business.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:01.470
We still had customers when 
my grandpa was healthy, but...

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:05.150
Maybe we have to close down, too.

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:06.260
Collette...

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.590
Useful information!

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:09.480
What?

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:14.360
Lunch Pack is a business owned by the 
family of Femiruna, the Maiden of Leo.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:18.350
If you, a Visitor, make the request, 
Femiruna may be able to help.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:20.110
I can lead you to her, if you want!

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:22.090
Please do, Mana.

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.870
I'm going over there.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.220
I understand.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:30.240
However, there's nothing I can do to help.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:33.580
Why not?! Collette, another maiden, 
is in trouble!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.840
I feel sorry for Collette,

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:40.890
but I can't let my personal feelings 
get in the way of our operations.

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:42.590
Can you help me out personally, then?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:43.880
I'm begging you!

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:46.100
Please, don't do that!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:50.380
In any case, I cannot help 
you with this matter.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.600
Please excuse me.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.600
Wait!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.960
Please let go of me!

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.960
Please just listen to what I have to say!

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:59.620
I told you to let go!

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.560
Femiruna?

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.200
Hey, Femiruna!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:20.800
Where...

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.120
am I?

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.040
What happened to me?

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:32.710
No!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.470
Don't get close to me! Stay away!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:39.150
No!

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:43.050
Who are you?

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:45.160
What do you want to do to me?

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.530
Good, looks like you're awake.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.410
Wh-What are you saying?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.160
You shouldn't move yet.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.830
Eat these, and get some rest.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.740
How was it?

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:08.010
She still seemed to be confused.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.930
We couldn't have a conversation, at all.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:14.430
From the looks of it, she'd be even 
more confused if she saw my face.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.930
Good thing I used this to hide 
my face, just as you said.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.860
It may have been an accident, 
but she hit her head really hard.

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.460
Yeah.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:25.110
But was this really a good idea?

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.890
Of course!

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:30.110
You may be the Visitor, but if 
you physically hurt a maiden,

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.440
it would definitely be a felony!

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.120
You might even be sentenced to death!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:37.120
There were no other options except 
 escaping with Femiruna!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.350
As a result, Femiruna is safe!

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:41.880
It's all for the best!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.770
But what I have done cannot be forgiven.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:49.550
If you feel guilty, then take 
good care of Femiruna.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.970
I'm sure she'll open up to you 
once she feels your sincerity.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.560
All right.

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.320
You have my thanks.

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:58.310
I've misunderstood you all this time.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.690
I thought you were a 
dirty raccoon that wanted

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:05.200
to create Star Children 
using any disgusting means.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.220
I'm so sorry.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.370
Don't worry about it!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.200
But make sure to thank Collette, too!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:14.200
She let us borrow the stockroom for Femiruna!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.200
Yeah, I'll go tell her.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:20.350
You said I'm a dirty raccoon that wanted

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:23.380
to create Star Children 
using any disgusting means?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.380
You're exactly right!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:29.710
I was wondering how we would conquer 
Femiruna, whose guard is always up,

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:31.260
but how convenient!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.010
A one-in-a-million chance!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.270
How will this turn out?

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.350
I have to get out of this place first.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.190
No way....

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:00.890
Where... is this place?!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:08.160
Onii-san, I've baked Femiruna-san's bread!

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.260
Thanks.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.630
I'll take it to her.

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.000
I hope she gets better soon.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:16.640
Don't worry, she'll get better 
once she eats your bread.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:25.400
Wh-What are you trying to 
achieve by doing this to me?

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.530
The bread is still here?

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.030
You didn't even take a bite?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.870
Are you after my body?!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:40.160
I'm worried about your body, 
but it won't get better without food.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.510
No! Stay away!

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.750
Don't taint me!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:45.920
Calm down.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.000
Fine.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.130
This is Collette's freshly-baked bread.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.630
No leftovers this time.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:00.680
Looks like he wants me to eat this bread.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.350
What did he put in it?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.320
I must not eat them, no matter what.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.860
I have to keep my dignity!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:15.620
I-I'm not eating it, no matter what.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:18.270
I'm not eating it, no matter what.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:18.680
You won't get better if you don't eat.

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:19.870
I'm not eating it, no matter what.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.210
Let's see how long you can keep up
 your dignified lady act!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.150
Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.990
Why aren't you eating?

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.660
Please, just have a bite!

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:02.540
Your threats won't work on me!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.290
Femiruna!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.750
Enough already!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.090
You're the Visitor...

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.630
Why aren't you eating?

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.090
You'll die at this rate!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:12.990
Why not...

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:15.450
It's true that I hurt you.

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:17.870
This is something that can't be undone.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.800
But...

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.870
My intention to help you is real.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:22.810
Please believe in me!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.810
You don't have to forgive me,

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:30.230
but you have to take
better care of yourself!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.560
Please!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.240
<i>This man...</i>

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:40.070
<i>He's so concerned about me.</i>

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:41.840
<i>Now that I think of it,</i>

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:44.000
<i>those who came close to me</i>

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:48.750
<i>were all after my father's wealth and power.</i>

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:54.140
<i>Such passionate eyes!</i>

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:59.670
<i>I've never met anyone like him before.</i>

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:04.270
<i>He's looking only at me!</i>

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.120
I can't move too well.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:16.670
Can you feed me the bread 
 you're so proud of?

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.280
Yes, of course.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.020
Here, open your mouth.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.370
You can open wider.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.540
Here, I'm putting it in.

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:36.460
Did you choke?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.040
Take it slow.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.720
I'm not a child!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:42.640
Looks like you're all better now.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.440
Hurry and give me more.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:46.470
Fine, fine.

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:51.930
It's delicious.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:52.730
Yeah.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.570
That's why I wanted you to try it.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.890
Y-You're such a schemer.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.930
N-Nothing.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.000
More bread...

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.080
I'm already full.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:08.970
But you've only had two bites.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.790
I'm already full!

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:12.980
Fine.

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:14.540
See you tomorrow.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:19.910
Well...

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:22.300
Have a good night.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:23.800
Good night.

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.310
Itsuki... sama...

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.060
The blond lady was an easy target, after all.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:33.340
When a person is placed in a situation 
different from their norm,

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:35.160
and when they spend a long 
time with another person,

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.590
they form strong bonds!

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:37.980
That was what Stockholm-san told me,

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.600
but who would've thought 
it would work so well!

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:43.070
It's just a matter of time now!

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:09.100
That was the first time...

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:12.430
I let a man touch my bare skin.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:16.560
Well... I'm sorry.

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:22.190
Uh, um... It's an honor.

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:22.820
Right!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:30.580
You'll take responsibility 
for tainting me, right?

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:34.220
Yes, Femiruna.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.780
Will you...

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.710
Will you have my...

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:42.720
Will you have my child?

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.470
Sheesh!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.690
You're so lame.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:55.560
Itsuki, I'll make the best Star Child!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:57.950
You're surprisingly aggressive.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.320
Of course!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.320
I'm Maiden of Leo, after all!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.920
No foreplay?!

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.770
No customers again today.

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:13.070
Collette... Collette...

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:16.890
Grandpa! You should be resting!

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:20.110
Collette... take this...

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:21.460
Take this...

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.340
Your bread recipes?

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:31.310
<b>Holy Star Festival</b>

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.310
Are you telling me to attend the 
school festival with these recipes?

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.280
Collette...

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:36.780
Ace... Aim for the ace!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.540
Grandpa...

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:40.820
I got it.

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:43.570
I'll do my best.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.040
<b>Will You Have My Child BlehBleh!</b>

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:40.060
Please Be My Chikuwa!

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:40.060
Chikuwa bread! Abalone bread!
